  "author_association": "NONE",
  "body": "Looking at the source code of `quantize_i2_s `, it seems that the buffer `q8` is [allocated on the heap](https://github.com/microsoft/BitNet/blob/a97dfe458afdf79831884d1928fb9f23f16d270b/src/ggml-bitnet-mad.cpp#L60C5-L60C57) but never freed. This would results in leaking memory each time the function is called.",
